{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755060/extras/d6b7aca070c2405fbfe25072ec3510d0.avif?t=1774436505\" width=560 height=220 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seventh is a fast-paced speedrun FPS that merges precise gunplay with fluid parkour movement. Set in a dark, stylized world inspired by the seven deadly sins, players take on the role of Wrath, a vengeful force breaking free to confront the sins that once imprisoned them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755060/extras/02223558457c3bedf9ee5c80ffd50d1b.webp?t=1774436505\" width=50 height=50 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master seamless movement and advanced parkour skills to blaze through meticulously designed levels. Eliminate enemies using one of three distinct weapons, each tailored to different combat scenarios. The game rewards precision, timing, and adaptability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755060/extras/02223558457c3bedf9ee5c80ffd50d1b.webp?t=1774436505\" width=50 height=50 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced FPS with parkour and speedrun mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seven chapters based on the deadly sins, each with unique aesthetics and bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill-based gunplay emphasizing aim mastery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Competitive elements like global leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online duel mode to race other gamers for the fastest completion</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755060/extras/02223558457c3bedf9ee5c80ffd50d1b.webp?t=1774436505\" width=50 height=50 /></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Replayability &amp; Community</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With hidden shortcuts, multiple run strategies, and a duel system, players can continuously refine their performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3755060?t=1774436505","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755060/6446e01f8a2aa72ad3796053de1f1dee3fe920fe/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774436505","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755060/75b885824663f7f3683faea279fd6e98cb13d91e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774436505","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755060/75b885824663f7f3683faea279fd6e98cb13d91e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774436505","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755060/extras/d6b7aca070c2405fbfe25072ec3510d0.avif?t=1774436505\" width=560 height=220 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seventh is a fast-paced speedrun FPS that merges precise gunplay with fluid parkour movement. Set in a dark, stylized world inspired by the seven deadly sins, players take on the role of Wrath, a vengeful force breaking free to confront the sins that once imprisoned them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755060/extras/02223558457c3bedf9ee5c80ffd50d1b.webp?t=1774436505\" width=50 height=50 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master seamless movement and advanced parkour skills to blaze through meticulously designed levels. Eliminate enemies using one of three distinct weapons, each tailored to different combat scenarios. The game rewards precision, timing, and adaptability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755060/extras/02223558457c3bedf9ee5c80ffd50d1b.webp?t=1774436505\" width=50 height=50 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced FPS with parkour and speedrun mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seven chapters based on the deadly sins, each with unique aesthetics and bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill-based gunplay emphasizing aim mastery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Competitive elements like global leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online duel mode to race other gamers for the fastest completion</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755060/extras/02223558457c3bedf9ee5c80ffd50d1b.webp?t=1774436505\" width=50 height=50 /></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Replayability &amp; Community</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With hidden shortcuts, multiple run strategies, and a duel system, players can continuously refine their performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Catbag Games","SinginGiant"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755060/bcb6e73304b215ad00c7272d89ce35c57e27f62d/header.jpg?t=